        "name": "Obesity induced by endocrinologic disorders or monogenetic/syndromic forms",
        "text": "Have obesity induced by other endocrinologic disorders, for example, Cushing Syndrome, or are diagnosed with monogenetic or syndromic forms of obesity, for example, Melanocortin 4 Receptor deficiency or Prader Willi Syndrome.",
        "instanceType": "EligibilityCriterionItem"
      },
